00:00:48.148 --> 00:00:50.683
MIDDLE-CLASS RESIDENTS WHO ARE

00:00:50.684 --> 00:00:53.085
TRYING TO FRAME THE HOMELESS.

00:00:53.086 --> 00:00:54.754
LOCAL NEWS BROADCASTERS GRABBED

00:00:54.755 --> 00:00:55.855
NATIONAL HEADLINES BY WARNING

00:00:55.856 --> 00:00:56.922
THAT SEATTLE IS DYING.

00:00:56.923 --> 00:00:58.991
THE CITY BECOMES UNLIVABLE FOR

00:00:58.992 --> 00:01:00.459
REGULAR FAMILIES.

00:01:00.460 --> 00:01:02.661
DAY THREE OF OUR "HOMELESS IN

00:01:02.662 --> 00:01:03.662
AMERICA" SERIES, OUR PRODUCER

00:01:03.663 --> 00:01:04.330
VISITED SEATTLE TO GET AN UP

00:01:04.331 --> 00:01:06.532
CLOSE LOOK AT WHAT'S HAPPENING

00:01:06.533 --> 00:01:10.569
THERE.

00:01:10.570 --> 00:01:11.837
SEATTLE'S HOMELESSNESS CRISIS IS

00:01:11.838 --> 00:01:12.638
DEEPLY CONNECTED TO THE CITY'S

00:01:12.639 --> 00:01:13.806
DRUG CRISIS.

00:01:13.807 --> 00:01:15.775
THAT'S WHAT WE LEARNED WHEN WE

00:01:15.776 --> 00:01:17.042
