00:01:17.043 --> 00:01:19.011
ENCAMPMENT OFF INTERSTATE 5.

00:01:19.012 --> 00:01:20.279
WASHINGTON NATIVE ERIC NELSON IS

00:01:20.280 --> 00:01:20.646
