00:01:24.918 --> 00:01:25.284
TREATMENT.

00:01:25.285 --> 00:01:27.420
HE CAME TO THIS ENCAMPMENT TO

00:01:27.421 --> 00:01:28.587
VISIT FRIENDS.

00:01:28.588 --> 00:01:31.023
&gt;&gt; DO YOU THINK DRUGS ARE ONE OF

00:01:31.024 --> 00:01:31.590
THE PRIMARY DRIVERS OF

00:01:31.591 --> 00:01:32.024
HOMELESSNESS?

00:01:32.025 --> 00:01:35.394
&gt;&gt; I THINK MENTAL HEALTH IS.

00:01:35.395 --> 00:01:36.162
MENTAL HEALTH IS THE FOUNDATION

00:01:36.163 --> 00:01:39.198
OF A LOT OF ADDICTION AND OTHER

00:01:39.199 --> 00:01:39.532
THINGS.

00:01:39.533 --> 00:01:41.000
&gt;&gt; Tucker: MENTAL HEALTH AND

00:01:41.001 --> 00:01:42.401
ADDICTION ARE CLEARLY PROBLEMS.

00:01:42.402 --> 00:01:44.437
WHEN WE ARRIVED ON WEDNESDAY

00:01:44.438 --> 00:01:45.237
AFTERNOON, THE RESIDENTS WERE

00:01:45.238 --> 00:01:46.138
CLEANING UP THEIR CAMP.

00:01:46.139 --> 00:01:49.508
IT WAS LITTERED WITH SYRINGES.

00:01:49.509 --> 00:01:52.178
&gt;&gt; HOW MANY PEOPLE, PERCENTAGE

00:01:52.179 --> 00:01:52.945
LIVING HERE OR DOING DRUGS?

00:01:52.946 --> 00:01:56.949
&gt;&gt; I WOULD SAY A GOOD 60%.

00:01:56.950 --> 00:02:00.019
THAT'S MAYBE A LITTLE SHORT, BUT

00:02:00.020 --> 00:02:00.786
THE BENEFIT OF THE DOUBT.

00:02:00.787 --> 00:02:04.223
&gt;&gt; HOW EASY IS IT TO GET HEROIN?

00:02:04.224 --> 00:02:05.157
REALLY, IT'S REALLY EASY.

00:02:05.158 --> 00:02:08.093
&gt;&gt; Tucker: OUTSIDE THE

00:02:08.094 --> 00:02:11.997
I-5 CAMP, THERE IS EVIDENCE OF A

00:02:11.998 --> 00:02:12.898
DRUG EPIDEMIC.

00:02:12.899 --> 00:02:15.267
AT A SHELTER WE FOUND THIS

00:02:15.268 --> 00:02:16.735
POSTER MORNING DRUG USERS OF THE

00:02:16.736 --> 00:02:18.571
DANGERS OF FENTANYL.

00:02:18.572 --> 00:02:20.639
SEATTLE IS A MECCA FOR DRUG

00:02:20.640 --> 00:02:20.973
ADDICTS.

00:02:20.974 --> 00:02:21.774
WASHINGTON STATE LEGALIZED

00:02:21.775 --> 00:02:22.641
MARIJUANA IN SEATTLE'S POLICE

00:02:22.642 --> 00:02:25.077
FORCE HAS A PROGRAM THAT REFERS

00:02:25.078 --> 00:02:27.012
SOME LOW-LEVEL DRUG CRIMINALS TO

00:02:27.013 --> 00:02:29.548
SOCIAL SERVICES INSTEAD OF JAIL,

00:02:29.549 --> 00:02:32.384
LIKE SAN FRANCISCO, SEATTLE CITY

00:02:32.385 --> 00:02:34.019
GOVERNMENT HAS ESSENTIALLY

00:02:34.020 --> 00:02:34.453
DECRIMINALIZED

00:02:34.454 --> 00:02:35.054
QUALITY-OF-LIFE CRIMES.

00:02:35.055 --> 00:02:36.922
MISDEMEANOR CITATIONS HAVE

00:02:36.923 --> 00:02:38.958
PLUMMETED SINCE 2009.

00:02:38.959 --> 00:02:39.425
THE CONSEQUENCE?

00:02:39.426 --> 00:02:41.060
SEE IT FOR YOURSELF.

00:02:41.061 --> 00:02:43.629
HERE IS A VIDEO OF A MAN PASSED

00:02:43.630 --> 00:02:44.864
