00:02:50.570 --> 00:02:52.705
THIS PICTURE SHOWS HUMAN WASTE A

00:02:52.706 --> 00:02:54.673
FEW STEPS ABOVE THAT.

00:02:54.674 --> 00:02:55.975
HOMELESSNESS BECAME MORE VISIBLE

00:02:55.976 --> 00:02:57.977
