BECAUSE OF THEIR LIBERAL

00:03:00.180 --> 00:03:01.580
ATTITUDES IN THE MILD CLIMATE,

00:03:01.581 --> 00:03:03.349
THE CITY IS A MAGNET FOR

00:03:03.350 --> 00:03:03.782
VAGRANTS.

