00:03:07.954 --> 00:03:09.989
&gt;&gt; PROBABLY MORE THAN HALF

00:03:09.990 --> 00:03:11.423
PROBABLY NOT FROM SEATTLE.

00:03:11.424 --> 00:03:12.424
&gt;&gt; Tucker: HOMELESSNESS IS

00:03:12.425 --> 00:03:12.825
COMPLICATED.

00:03:12.826 --> 00:03:13.626
