00:03:21.801 --> 00:03:23.469
LIKE MOST OF THE WEST COAST,

00:03:23.470 --> 00:03:25.304
SEATTLE'S ECONOMIC BOOM HAS NOT

00:03:25.305 --> 00:03:26.672
BEEN DISTRIBUTED EVENLY.

00:03:26.673 --> 00:03:27.206
NOT CLOSE.

00:03:27.207 --> 00:03:28.541
WHEN WAGES AT THE LOW-END BACK

00:03:28.542 --> 00:03:29.942
OF THE ECONOMIC SPECTRUM FAILED

00:03:29.943 --> 00:03:31.377
TO GIVE UP WITH RISING COST OF

00:03:31.378 --> 00:03:35.281
LIVING, YOU WIND UP WITH A PLACE

00:03:35.282 --> 00:03:37.149
WHERE PEOPLE LIVING IN THEIR

00:03:37.150 --> 00:03:37.917
