00:03:40.787 --> 00:03:43.656
SO WHAT CAUSES HOMELESSNESS?

00:03:43.657 --> 00:03:44.924
MANY THINGS.

00:03:44.925 --> 00:03:47.993
DRUG ADDICTION, ECONOMIC

00:03:47.994 --> 00:03:48.527
