00:03:56.303 --> 00:03:56.802
WAS 16 YEARS OLD.

00:03:56.803 --> 00:03:58.771
&gt;&gt; WE KIND OF SPLIT.

00:03:58.772 --> 00:03:59.505
WE DIDN'T REALLY HAVE TOO MUCH

00:03:59.506 --> 00:04:02.575
