00:04:05.545 --> 00:04:06.979
AND THEN I RAN OUT OF MONEY.

00:04:06.980 --> 00:04:09.682
I RAN OUT OF EVERYTHING SO I WAS

00:04:09.683 --> 00:04:11.183
